BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rmr-150csr41@wvaihub.com
DTSTAMP:20261103T205852Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T170000
SUMMARY:Rule-Making Review Committee: the PSC's HB 2014 capacity rule
LOCATION:Senate Judiciary Committee room\, State Capitol\, 1900 Kanawha Bl
 vd. E.\, Charleston\, WV 25305
DESCRIPTION:On the agenda: 150 CSR 41\, the PSC's rules for generating cap
 acity and economic dispatch\, written in Case 26-0633-E-GI. This is the r
 ule that made a 69% coal capacity factor a goal instead of a mandate.\nHo
 w to take part: Open to the public. The committee can recommend the rule 
 be approved\, amended\, or withdrawn before the 2027 session.\nInterim ag
 enda (Nov 9–11): https://www.wvlegislature.gov/committees/interims/intc
 omsched_agenda.cfm?day1=11/09/2026\nWest Virginia Watch: https://westvirg
 iniawatch.com/2026/10/20/west-virginia-public-service-commission-makes-po
 wer-rule-a-goal-not-a-mandate/\nVia WV AI Watch: https://wvaihub.com/#/ca
 lendar?e=rmr-150csr41
URL:https://www.wvlegislature.gov/committees/interims/intcomsched_agenda.c
 fm?day1=11/09/2026
END:VEVENT
